1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:02,450
(Leonard:)It certainly is.

2
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:04,420
(Leonard:)Okay.

3
00:00:05,350 --> 00:00:07,120
(Sheldon:)I have guests coming.

4
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:10,490
(Sheldon:)I'm afraid I'm going to have
to ask you to leave now.

5
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:13,330
(Leonard:)I am leaving.

6
00:00:13,330 --> 00:00:15,830
(Sheldon:)Don't make this harder
than it is, Leonard.

7
00:00:15,830 --> 00:00:17,700
(Leonard:)Good-bye, Sheldon.

8
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:19,500
(Sheldon:)And good-bye to you, sir.

9
00:00:25,770 --> 00:00:27,310
(Sheldon:)He'll be back.

10
00:00:27,310 --> 00:00:28,890
LEONARD:
Of course I'll be back.

11
00:00:28,890 --> 00:00:31,080
(Leonard:)I live here!

12
00:00:46,050 --> 00:00:47,390
(Sheldon:)Well, it would appear

13
00:00:47,390 --> 00:00:49,690
(Sheldon:)LeVar Burton
won't be joining us.

14
00:00:49,690 --> 00:00:51,960
(Sheldon:)Let's get started.

15
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:54,330
(Sheldon:)I thought we'd begin
by going around the room,

16
00:00:54,330 --> 00:00:55,600
(Sheldon:)introducing ourselves

17
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:58,030
(Sheldon:)and saying a little bit
about why we're here.

18
00:00:58,030 --> 00:00:59,730
Okay. (clears throat)
I'm Sheldon.

